<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICAN INSURER HOLLARD TO BUY CRUSADER LIFE.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICAN INSURER HOLLARD TO BUY CRUSADER LIFE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Hollard Insurance Co Ltd said on Friday it would buy Crusader Life Assurance Corp Ltd for more than 18.5 million rand.</p>
</text>
